== Walkthrough ==

<ul><li>''Hail, Lorekeeper Zorik
</li><li>Zorik: I seek those who practice the art of dark magicks. I seek those who call themselves necromancers. Are you a necromancer?
</li><li>say: I am a necromancer
</li><li>Zorik: Excellent. Are you sure enough of your skills to undertake my taksks? If not, get out of my sight, weakling!
</li><li>Say: I will undertake your tasks.
</li><li>Zorik: I thought so. One should never back down from a challenge. Once you have completed them, I will have a cap, a robe, sleeves, wristbands, gloves, leggings and boots to reward you with.
</li><li>Say: What <enter piece>
</li></ul>

'''After turn-in:'''

Lorekeeper Zorik smiles warmly as he hands you your reward. 'You have done well, _____.'

